I stand at the bus stop.
The bus is the first part of the trip.
First, I travel by bus.
Afterwards, I take the metro.
I look down the street.
After five minutes, the bus arrives.
It is a long and yellow bus.
The bus stops right in front of me.
The doors open.
I step up into the bus.
I have my travel card in my hand.
I scan the card by the door.
There are many passengers today.
I look for an empty seat.
I find a good seat by the window.
I sit down.
I look out at the city.
Now I take the bus to the metro station.
